Interfaz del ADE calcada de Backroom
https://github.com/AdrianAlonsoDev/backroom, commit 4ca0ae9

Copiado de allí: backroom.css (cortes de sections.css, workspace-preview.css, landing.css,
landing-theme.css, v3/foundation.css y palette-blue.css), Mascot.tsx, WorkTile.tsx y las nubes
hero-clouds-night-blue.webp y hero-clouds-compact-night-blue.webp. Las fuentes de ./fonts son
DM Sans (SIL OFL 1.1, ver fonts/OFL.txt).

